// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Captain Nolan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4135245288" "Captain Nolan"
// ProfessionString :
"P3927094520" "PPD Captain"
// DescriptionString :
"P4208233740" "Captain Nolan has been with the PPD for over twenty years. He works the patrol for Peregrine Island, but as of late has been seeing some very odd cases appear on his desk."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P4141963685" "<color orange>You must become a VIP in order to access this contact.</color>"
// LocationString :
"P891522995" "Peregrine Island"
// HelloString :
"P2840620893" "Let's get to work."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2860664428" "It's good to see you, {HeroName}. Keep up the good work."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3778880564" "{HeroName}, thanks for coming. The situation we have calls for someone of your... power level. Allow me to explain.<br><br>We've had a series of deaths in Paragon as of late, starting a little before we had to shut the doors to <color red>Dark Astoria</color>. The autopsy reports say that some of them were suicides, while others were murders. However, the one thing they had in common was some sort of religious symbolism behind all of the deaths. The victims believed they had done something wrong and deserved to be punished.<br><br>We sent in <color orange>Detective Hopp</color> to investigate the case, but now he's gone missing. We then sent in some heroes to check it out, but they're gone too. We even requested help from a small supergroup, but... well, they're <i>also</i> missing now.<br><br>This is why I've asked for your help, now that you're an Incarnate. Whatever is going on here is bigger than us, {HeroName}, and I think it has to do with whatever is flaring up in Dark Astoria."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1407466711" "No luck on the case, {HeroName}? I know there's probably bigger problems to handle in Dark Astoria. Good luck."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1251567081" "You've got too much on your plate, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1705395512" "Players shouldn’t see the come back later string."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3741295102" "FailsafeLevel"
// IntroString :
"P2049933865" "Introduction"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2066226271" "Intro accept"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2826310298" "Intro send off"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1060484728" "Introduce one contact"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3673397332" "Introduce two contacts"
