// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Dream_Doctor_DA 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dream Doctor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3218415624" "Dream Doctor"
// ProfessionString :
"P4275405876" "Midnighter Club Founder"
// DescriptionString :
"P3587385026" "The Dream Doctor is the founder of the Midnighter Club. He originally discovered the workings of the Circle of Thorns in the 1930s and stopped them from kidnapping children from their homes.<br><br>Since those events, he has risen to almost legendary power while fighting the Thorns, founding the Midnight Squad, and fighting off the cosmic power of Rularuu. After all of those events, Dream Doctor vanished into dreamspace, claiming he was out to save the world yet again.<br><br>Dream Doctor has returned now, revealed as the letter writer who has been fighting against Ouroboros. He will not stop his crusade against the organization until he knows that humanity is safe from the terrors he believes they hold."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
"P2011343611" "???"
// HelloString :
"P731960763" "The time is now, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
// FirstVisitString :
"P2123905169" "The events in Cimerora have served to make you immune to Mot's power, {HeroName}. We must work fast, however. We bought ourselves some time with the destruction of the Knives of Vengeance, but not a lot of it.<br><br>Mot is beginning to absorb weaker heroes and villains who are near Dark Astoria... not even <i>inside</i> of the area now. You and I must deal with the <color yellow>Talons of Vengeance</color> and the <color yellow>Tsoo</color> once and for all if we are to finally stop Mot.<br><br>This won't be easy, not by a longshot, and I'm not even entirely sure this plan of mine will work, but it's the only option we have. Let's get started."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2127239249" "Dark Astoria and the world are saved from Mot, but Ouroboros still looms as a threat. We will continue our fight against them soon, {HeroName}."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2191571518" "You have too much to deal with at the moment, {HeroName}. Speak with me again when you've freed yourself from your burdens."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3926932657" "<color orange>Dream Doctor will be waiting for you back in the present time to deal with Dark Astoria.</color>"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P406469233" "Return to the present to work with Dream Doctor"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1433352644" "<color orange>You decide to head back to the present and work with Dream Doctor to fight Mot.</color>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


