// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Ephram Sha 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3893427710" "Ephram Sha"
// ProfessionString :
"P1012502308" "Wandering Master"
// DescriptionString :
"P1773775577" "Ephram Sha is a martial artist and spiritual guru of great fame. After mastering the ancient art of Kalaripayattu, he chose to wander the earth in search of inner harmony, rather than join the ranks of the Kalari Gurukkal. It was during these travels that he encountered Montague Castanella, who recognized Ephram's connection to the arcane realms. Montague invited Ephram into the Midnighter Club, where Ephram quickly became one of the Midnight Squad's most dependable agents.<br><br>The one quality that has made Ephram invaluable to the Midnighters is his clarity of mind; no matter the situation, Ephram Sha retains a firm grasp on his surroundings. This made him an obvious choice when it came time to send agents to Dark Astoria, where visions of horror haunt one's every step."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3746547064" "Greetings, {HeroName}. Let us attempt to push back this darkness."
// HelloString :
"P1675311219" "My meditations have revealed disturbing truths. We must act quickly."
// HelloString :
"P2296766166" "Your assistance is most appreciated, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2616607290" "Who are you, stranger? Are you a fellow spirit, seeking refuge in the light? Or are you a vision, sent to lead me into darkness? If I cannot be sure of which, then I'm afraid I cannot help you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3044170510" "I have no tasks remaining for you. This is probably a bug, as all of my tasks are available to level 50 characters and are repeatable. Please file a bug report."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2678410879" "Your spirit is troubled, {HeroName}. One cannot combat the darkness with a divided mind. Return to me when you are unburdened with the weight of your current tasks."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P253538700" "You are brave to come here, Hero. However, I fear that if you were to face the darkness now, your power would only end up feeding Mot. When you are stronger, come see me, and we shall face the darkness together."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1982889674" "Jigga-what?"
// IntroString :
"P1894008871" "Meet with Ephram Sha"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1520088778" "Ephram Sha is a pillar of sanity in this hellish place. If you're looking to make headway in the struggle for Dark Astoria, you may wish to speak with him. He can show you where your powers can achieve the greatest good."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1712688668" "I'll let Ephram know to expect you."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1021761391" "There is a spirit in need, not far from here, {HeroName}. I believe it may be best if you sought it out."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3832855508" "There are spirits in need, not far from here, {HeroName}. I believe it may be best if you sought them out."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


