// Name :
"P3610563916" "Maharaj"
// ProfessionString :
"P1181674108" "Mage of the Circle"
// DescriptionString :
"P504937512" "In a land where death itself can drive one insane, a Master of Madness will thrive. Maharaj is one of the most ancient and powerful magi in the Circle of Thorns, and he is well-served by his assignment to Dark Astoria. Here, in this land of terror and hopelessness, Maharaj thrives. Though the Circle's influence in Dark Astoria is meager, Maharaj has learned to forge alliances with those outside the Circle. He has found that if the right information reaches the right ears, often the Circle can achieve its goals without ever lifting a finger."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P4067938969" "{HeroName}. A pleasure."
// HelloString :
"P2871890866" "Mmm, have you come seeking my counsel? How fortuitous."
// HelloString :
"P1328662870" "Ahhhh, {HeroName}. Just the {Hero.gender=male man|woman} I wanted to see."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P627026802" "I'm afraid my plans do not involve you at the moment. If you knew me at all, you would be glad of that fact."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1176229875" "I fear I have nothing more for you, {HeroName}. My well of wisdom has... run dry."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P436685848" "You look positively <i>exhausted</i>, my friend. I cannot ask anything more of you, while you are in such a state. Once you are... less burdened, I may have some interesting tidbits for you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3356374810" "Your pardon, {HeroName}, but I do believe this next task is a little... rough, if you know what I mean. That is, I wouldn't want you to come to any harm, given your... limitations. I'm sure we understand one another?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P234078359" "I have no idea what's going on, {HeroName}, and that's saying something. I'm a Madness Mage, for goodness' sake! I suggest writing a bug report about it, but that's just me."
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
