// Name :
"P3046324481" "Mu'Vorkan"
// ProfessionString :
"P303661933" "Mu Mystic"
// DescriptionString :
"P844091771" "Mu'Vorkan is a powerful Mu Mystic who joined the Arachnos organization some time ago. He has quickly risen through the ranks, thanks to his natural magical abilities and the strong Mu blood that flows through him. However, despite all of that, he is still just a faceless Mu in the army that is Arachnos."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1611350380" "We shall solve this problem of Mot, once and for all."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P376047027" "Dark Astoria is a dangerous place, even for one such as yourself, {HeroName}. Be on your guard."
// FirstVisitString :
"P684739299" "{HeroName}. The woman known as Heather Townshend has done what I have hoped. {Hero.type=hero I have hopes that you and I can be civil and work together, despite your status as a hero and my status as, well, Arachnos.|I assume you've had a sordid past with Arachnos. Anyone of your stature most likely has. However, I can assure you that I am here to help, not hinder.}<br><br>The problem of Dark Astoria is one that concerns Lord Recluse greatly. He has sent Scirocco, Ice Mistral, and myself to deal with it. Scirocco believes that Lord Recluse wishes to somehow utilize the power of Mot to his own end, perhaps due to his link with the power of <color red>Tartarus</color>.<br><br>However, Recluse is not here personally, so we shall... use our own judgement regarding Mot."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1398929697" "I shall stay here, {HeroName}. I've been requested to continue monitoring the situation in Dark Astoria."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2843072284" "You have too much to handle, {HeroName}. Settle your matters, then return to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3180677273" "Players should never see this."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1903321330" "I'm not too sure how much you can trust Mu'Vorkan, but it seems he's the best shot towards solving all these problems around here."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P420882489" "Meet with Mu'Vorkan"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1032929006" "{Hero.type=hero Be careful with this guy,|I'm sure someone like you can handle this person,} {HeroName}."
