// Contact Name : Sister Solaris 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P284457898" "Sister Solaris"
// ProfessionString :
"P3861196140" "Sybil Matriarch"
// DescriptionString :
"P463176083" "Sister Solaris is the matriarch of the Seers. She has the strongest connection to the Oracle and therefore the greatest ability to glean the futures of mankind."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
"P744849347" "Cimerora"
// HelloString :
"P3701689590" "There is still much to do before Cimerora is safe."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P470580405" "I apologize, {HeroName}, there is much for me to scry for the future of Cimerora. I cannot speak with you at the moment."
// FirstVisitString :
"P939676713" "{HeroName}... it is very coincidental that you're here now, speaking with me. It can only be a sign that those from a distant time have been sent to save us from certain destruction.<br><br>My dreams have been troubled as of late, both by the rumblings of Romulus Augustus and also from a different terror, a being that is the essence of death. Romulus, you see, has gone missing from his place of imprisonment<br><br>The former with Romulus cannot be handled just yet, but the latter, I believe, can be handled.<br><br>Will you, {Hero.type=hero a person of honor, of bravery|despite your aura of vileness}, choose to help Cimerora against this new threat?<br><br><color orange>{Hero.type=hero You have to wonder, if Cimerora was a lost civilization, are you nearing the event that caused it to be destroyed?|You'll have to play the role of savior, for now. The best way to gaining Mot's power, along with anyone else's, will be to protect yourself from his abilities.}"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P21106484" "Marcus Valerius will be setting sail soon, {HeroName}. Thank you, for all of your help."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2393783682" "You've too much to handle, {HeroName}. The people of Cimerora need your full, undivided attention."
// ComeBackLaterString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1977914430" "<color orange>Ajax told you that Sister Solaris was somehow now tied to Mot and that she was expecting someone like you. You'll have to travel back in time to Cimerora to meet her.</color>"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P965351786" "Find Sister Solaris"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2272341427" "<color orange>You head off to Cimerora to speak with Sister Solaris and discover the nature of Mot.</color>"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1370647217" "<color orange>You'll need to return to Dark Astoria and work together with the Dream Doctor to finish the fight with Mot, once and for all.</color>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
